      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "flour",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "all-purpose"
    },
    {
      "name": "water",
      "amount": "1/4 cup"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a food processor, combine chickpeas, melted vegetable shortening, char-grill seasoning, smoked paprika, garlic powder, onion powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Process the mixture until it is well combined and slightly chunky.",
    "Add the flour and water to the mixture and process until a thick batter forms.",
    "Using your hands, shape the batter into small falafel patties.",
    "Place the falafel patties on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Bake the falafel for 20 minutes, flipping them halfway through.",
    "Serve the falafel hot in a lacquerware bowl."
  ],
